-In general, the
-xref:redundant-load-balance.adoc[redundant-load-balance] statement is
-more useful than this one.
-
-[ statements ]:: One or more `unlang` commands.  Only one of the
-statements is executed.
-
-.Examples
-
-[source,unlang]
-----
-load-balance &User-Name {
-    sql1
-    sql2
-}
-----
